{"4978010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Everybody Loves a Good Hole", "steam_appid": 4978010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody Loves a Good Hole is a short, satisfying incremental about steering a black hole and swallowing everything in sight. Devour colorful cubes for XP and coins, grow bigger, and pour it all into a deep upgrade tree. Bigger cubes, wilder chaos, just one more run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a black hole with your mouse. Pull in hundreds of colorful cubes. Grow. Repeat — but bigger every time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.mp4?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swallow everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your black hole across a bright, chaotic world packed with colorful cubes. Small ones vanish instantly; bigger ones take patience, upgrades, or the right power. The bigger you grow, the more you devour.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.mp4?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn cubes into power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cube pays out twice: XP to grow your hole mid-run, and coins to keep and spend between runs. Runs are timed, so every second counts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/8f2c39442abb8e6e894b8753b4eafd24.mp4?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dig into a deep upgrade tree</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your coins on permanent upgrades — longer runs, wider pull, richer cubes, bigger starting size — and unlock entirely new cube types worth far more than the last.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/c18c69842385d6bb000586a9a954f7d7.mp4?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash magic-book powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb magic books mid-run to trigger temporary skills like Rain Mode, Duplicate and Magnet. Level them up in the tree, chain them together, and watch the screen erupt into buttery-smooth chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/316e8e5a36360711d98ef46ca2faf143.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/316e8e5a36360711d98ef46ca2faf143.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just one more run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, snappy runs and that itch to go again. Chase milestones, unlock the next power, beat your last haul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕳️ <strong>Steer &amp; swallow</strong> — mouse-driven black hole gameplay, easy to learn in seconds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Deep upgrade tree</strong> — permanent upgrades across multiple branches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📚 <strong>Magic-book skills</strong> — unleash and level up powers like Rain Mode, Duplicate and Magnet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Colorful, chaotic world</strong> — hundreds of cubes on screen at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧊 <strong>Escalating cube types</strong> — unlock bigger cubes worth more XP and coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Short &amp; satisfying</strong> — quick runs, pure dopamine, no filler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Fully localized</strong> — playable in 15 languages</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody Loves a Good Hole is a short, satisfying incremental about steering a black hole and swallowing everything in sight. Devour colorful cubes for XP and coins, grow bigger, and pour it all into a deep upgrade tree. Bigger cubes, wilder chaos, just one more run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a black hole with your mouse. Pull in hundreds of colorful cubes. Grow. Repeat — but bigger every time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/edc398dee51dc3cd30a6960c06e79da3.mp4?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Swallow everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your black hole across a bright, chaotic world packed with colorful cubes. Small ones vanish instantly; bigger ones take patience, upgrades, or the right power. The bigger you grow, the more you devour.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.poster.avif?t=1785603203\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.webm?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4978010/extras/665d56e90d8d33e683357cff338948d5.mp4?t=1785603203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn cubes into power</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E